==Battleground==
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 15~20 seconds<sup>450f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 12~15 seconds<sup>360f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**12 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Essentially all this stage boils down to spamming strong anti-Red and rusher Cats, such as [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]]. Having [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] also helps rush.

